-atlas/texas/stonewall-county"],["ARC or PLC in Stonewall County","/arc-plc/texas/stonewall-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 171% of normal in April to May and 34% of normal in November to December. So far in 2026 on the middle of the grids, February to March came in at 31% of normal and June to July at 90%.</p>"}
